{"seq":1,"slug":"ode-kinetic-modeling","title":"ODE 与动力学建模","url":"/l-doc-books/h/biology-life-science/systems-biology/methods/ode-kinetic-modeling","wordCount":1714,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"ode-与动力学建模\">ODE 与动力学建模</h1><p>前面三篇网络文章反复提到「要精确预测动态，需要 ODE 建模」——本篇就来兑现这个承诺。常微分方程（ODE）建模是系统生物学最经典、最定量的工具：它把生物分子的浓度当作随时间连续变化的变量，用微分方程描述它们的变化速率，从而能精确算出「某个浓度在第几秒达到峰值」「这个开关在什么参数下会翻转」。它回答的是<a href=\"../networks-modeling/\">网络与建模</a>章节留下的所有定量动态问题：双稳态、振荡、超敏、适应到底如何发生。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>ODE 建模的出发点是质量作用定律：化学反应的速率正比于反应物浓度的乘积。对一个分子 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span></span></span></span></span>，它的浓度变化率等于「所有生成它的反应速率之和」减去「所有消耗它的反应速率之和」。把网络里每个分子都写成这样一个方程，就得到一个 ODE 方程组——它完整地编码了系统的动态。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[网络结构&lt;br/&gt;谁影响谁] --&gt; B[为每个分子写速率方程&lt;br/&gt;dX/dt = 生成 - 消耗]&#10;    C[速率定律&lt;br/&gt;质量作用/米氏/Hill] --&gt; B&#10;    B --&gt; D[ODE 方程组]&#10;    E[参数&lt;br/&gt;速率常数 k] --&gt; F[数值积分求解]&#10;    G[初始浓度] --&gt; F&#10;    D --&gt; F&#10;    F --&gt; H[浓度时间曲线]&#10;    H --&gt; I[稳态/振荡/开关分析]&#10;    I --&gt; J[与实验数据比对]&#10;    J -.参数估计.-&gt; E\">flowchart TD\n    A[网络结构&lt;br/&gt;谁影响谁] --&gt; B[为每个分子写速率方程&lt;br/&gt;dX/dt = 生成 - 消耗]\n    C[速率定律&lt;br/&gt;质量作用/米氏/Hill] --&gt; B\n    B --&gt; D[ODE 方程组]\n    E[参数&lt;br/&gt;速率常数 k] --&gt; F[数值积分求解]\n    G[初始浓度] --&gt; F\n    D --&gt; F\n    F --&gt; H[浓度时间曲线]\n    H --&gt; I[稳态/振荡/开关分析]\n    I --&gt; J[与实验数据比对]\n    J -.参数估计.-&gt; E</pre><p>ODE 建模与 hub 里其他建模范式各有适用边界，选错框架会事倍功半：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>框架</th>\n<th>变量类型</th>\n<th>需要参数</th>\n<th>擅长</th>\n<th>不擅长</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>ODE 动力学</td>\n<td>连续浓度</td>\n<td>速率常数</td>\n<td>精确时程、振荡</td>\n<td>大网络、参数稀缺</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"boolean-logical-models\">布尔逻辑</a></td>\n<td>0/1 状态</td>\n<td>仅逻辑</td>\n<td>大网络、定性</td>\n<td>精确时间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"constraint-genome-scale\">约束 FBA</a></td>\n<td>稳态通量</td>\n<td>化学计量</td>\n<td>全基因组代谢</td>\n<td>瞬态、信号</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>随机模拟</td>\n<td>离散分子数</td>\n<td>速率常数</td>\n<td>低拷贝数噪声</td>\n<td>计算昂贵</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"速率定律-方程的血肉\">速率定律：方程的血肉</h2><p>写 ODE 的核心技艺，是给每个反应选对「速率定律」。最基础的是质量作用：反应 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A + B \\to C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 的速率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k[A][B]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>。但生物反应大多由酶催化，酶会饱和，于是用米氏（Michaelis-Menten）动力学：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>K</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v = \\frac{V_{max}[S]}{K_m + [S]}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.53em;vertical-align:-0.52em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.01em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1645em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">]</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.485em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1645em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">]</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.52em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是最大速率、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>K</mi><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K_m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是半饱和常数。当底物浓度远低于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>K</mi><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K_m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 时近似线性，远高于时趋于饱和——这种饱和是细胞代谢稳态的基础。</p>\n<p>当一个反应需要多个分子协同（如转录因子二聚体结合）或表现出开关式响应时，用 Hill 方程 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>S</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>K</mi><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>S</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v = \\frac{V_{max}[S]^n}{K^n + [S]^n}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.53em;vertical-align:-0.52em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.01em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5935em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.786em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\"><span class=\"mclose mtight\">]</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5935em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.786em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.485em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1645em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\"><span class=\"mclose mtight\">]</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7385em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.931em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.52em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>，Hill 系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n&gt;1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 表示协同性，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 越大响应越陡。这正是<a href=\"../networks-modeling/signaling-dynamics\">信号网络与动力学</a>里讲的「超敏」和<a href=\"../networks-modeling/gene-regulatory-networks\">基因调控网络</a>里「陡峭开关」的数学来源。一个简化的基因表达加降解模型可写成：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>β</mi><mfrac><msup><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msup><mrow><msup><mi>K</mi><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mi>γ</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{dp}{dt} = \\beta \\frac{a^n}{K^n+a^n} - \\gamma p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2772em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9322em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.4461em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3143em;vertical-align:-0.4033em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.911em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5935em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.786em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5935em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.786em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7385em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.931em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4033em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>，其中第一项是受激活子 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span> 调控的合成、第二项是降解。选对速率定律，方程才能反映真实生物学。</p>\n<h2 id=\"求解-分析与参数估计\">求解、分析与参数估计</h2><p>写出方程只是开始。ODE 方程组绝大多数没有解析解，必须数值积分——给定初始浓度和参数，用数值方法（如 LSODA、Runge-Kutta）一步步算出浓度随时间的曲线。生物 ODE 常是「刚性」的（不同反应时间尺度差几个数量级），需要专门的刚性求解器。</p>\n<p>但系统生物学真正关心的往往不是某条具体曲线，而是定性行为：系统有几个稳态？稳不稳定？会不会振荡？这要用动力系统理论——找不动点、算雅可比矩阵的特征值判断稳定性、做分岔分析（bifurcation analysis）看参数变化如何让系统从单稳态突变为双稳态或振荡。分岔图是理解<a href=\"../networks-modeling/gene-regulatory-networks\">基因调控网络</a>里双稳态开关的核心工具。最大的现实难题是参数估计：速率常数极难直接测量，通常只能通过「拟合实验数据反推参数」（参数估计/模型校准）。而生物模型常常「参数不可辨识」——很多组不同参数都能拟合同样的数据，这是 ODE 建模最棘手的陷阱，需要敏感性分析来诊断哪些参数真正重要。</p>\n<h2 id=\"确定性与随机性\">确定性与随机性</h2><p>ODE 隐含一个假设：分子数量大到可以当成连续的浓度。但细胞里很多关键分子（如某些转录因子、信号蛋白）拷贝数极低——可能只有几十个。这时「浓度」是个糟糕的近似，反应的随机性（一个分子结合还是不结合）会主导行为，产生基因表达噪声。</p>\n<p>这时要用随机方法。Gillespie 算法（随机模拟算法 SSA）精确模拟每一次反应事件的发生，给出分子数的随机轨迹——它能再现 ODE 抹掉的噪声，揭示「同基因型细胞为何表型不同」这类现象。代价是计算极其昂贵。化学主方程（CME）则给出概率分布随时间的演化，但几乎无法解析求解。确定性 ODE 与随机模拟之间的选择，本质是「分子多不多、噪声重不重要」的权衡。这种细胞间的随机异质性，正是<a href=\"../applications/single-cell-systems\">单细胞系统生物学</a>要直面的核心现象。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n<th>输出</th>\n<th>成本</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>确定性 ODE</td>\n<td>高拷贝数</td>\n<td>平均浓度时程</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Gillespie SSA</td>\n<td>低拷贝数</td>\n<td>随机轨迹</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>化学主方程 CME</td>\n<td>需完整分布</td>\n<td>概率分布演化</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"工具生态与-2026-实践\">工具生态与 2026 实践</h2><p>ODE 建模有成熟的工具链。模型交换用 SBML 标准格式，让模型能在不同软件间流通；COPASI 提供图形界面做模拟、参数估计、分岔分析；Python 生态里 Tellurium/libRoadRunner、以及通用的 SciPy <code>odeint</code>/<code>solve_ivp</code> 都广泛使用。生物模型库 BioModels 收录了数千个已发表的、可复现的 ODE 模型，是学习和复用的宝库。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from scipy.integrate import solve_ivp&#10;def repressilator(t, y, beta, n, K, gamma):&#10;    m1, m2, m3 = y                      # 三个互相抑制的基因&#10;    dm1 = beta*K**n/(K**n+m3**n) - gamma*m1&#10;    dm2 = beta*K**n/(K**n+m1**n) - gamma*m2&#10;    dm3 = beta*K**n/(K**n+m2**n) - gamma*m3&#10;    return [dm1, dm2, dm3]              # 合适参数下产生振荡\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> scipy.integrate </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> solve_ivp</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> repressilator</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(t, y, beta, n, K, gamma):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    m1, m2, m3 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> y                      </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 三个互相抑制的基因</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    dm1 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> beta</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">K</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">**</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">n</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(K</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">**</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">n</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">m3</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">**</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">n) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gamma</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">m1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    dm2 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> beta</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">K</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">**</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">n</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(K</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">**</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">n</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">m1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">**</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">n) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gamma</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">m2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    dm3 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> beta</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">K</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">**</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">n</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(K</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">**</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">n</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">m2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">**</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">n) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gamma</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">m3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [dm1, dm2, dm3]              </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 合适参数下产生振荡</span></span></code></pre></div><p>尽管 2026 年深度学习和<a href=\"../applications/single-cell-systems\">基础模型</a>风头正劲，机制性 ODE 建模并未过时——恰恰相反，它提供了纯数据模型缺乏的可解释性与外推能力。当前一个活跃方向是「机制 + 机器学习」的混合：用神经网络学习未知的速率项（如通用微分方程 Universal Differential Equations），在数据稀缺处保留机制约束。ODE 的精确性使它至今仍是<a href=\"../applications/synthetic-medical\">合成与医学应用</a>里数字孪生的定量内核。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>ODE 建模把分子浓度当连续变量，用质量作用、米氏、Hill 等速率定律写出微分方程组，精确刻画系统动态。</li>\n<li>选对速率定律是核心技艺：米氏描述酶饱和、Hill 描述协同与超敏，对应<a href=\"../networks-modeling/signaling-dynamics\">信号</a>与<a href=\"../networks-modeling/gene-regulatory-networks\">调控网络</a>的开关行为。</li>\n<li>求解靠数值积分（注意刚性），分析靠动力系统理论（不动点、稳定性、分岔）；参数估计与不可辨识性是最大陷阱。</li>\n<li>当分子拷贝数低时确定性 ODE 失效，需 Gillespie 随机模拟捕捉噪声——这正是<a href=\"../applications/single-cell-systems\">单细胞</a>异质性的根源。</li>\n<li>工具用 SBML/COPASI/Tellurium，2026 年「机制+机器学习」混合建模兴起，ODE 仍是数字孪生的可解释定量内核。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"ODE 与动力学建模","id":"ode-与动力学建模"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"速率定律：方程的血肉","id":"速率定律-方程的血肉"},{"level":2,"text":"求解、分析与参数估计","id":"求解-分析与参数估计"},{"level":2,"text":"确定性与随机性","id":"确定性与随机性"},{"level":2,"text":"工具生态与 2026 实践","id":"工具生态与-2026-实践"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"信号网络与动力学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/biology-life-science/systems-biology/networks-modeling/signaling-dynamics"},"next":{"title":"布尔与逻辑模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/biology-life-science/systems-biology/methods/boolean-logical-models"}}